Hi everyone! If you fear the game’s dead and forgotten, you could never be more wrong! We're working really hard on new levels and features! 
Here are [b]19 achievements[/b] as a bonus for your patience! 
Most of the achievements will unblock automatically if you earned them. Just start the game to get them!

[h1]In today’s update:[/h1] [list]
[*]Improved stability – no more crashes; 
[*][b]DirectX 11[/b] support;
[*]Confirm key actions by pressing [b]E[/b];
[*]Game save take much less time; 
[*]You can now see the number of hidden items and quest progress displayed in the level menu; 
[*]The Sphinx quest bug after loading fixed; 
[*]Enemies don't spawn infinitely;
[*]Enemies don’t reappear after level restart; 
[*]The default language settings now match the OS language, with English as the first choice; 
[*]Character freeze in some locations - now fixed; 
[*]Poor performance on final levels - now fixed.
[/list]
Gamepad:
[*]Last used tab in the pause menu now saved; 
[*]No cursor when using a gamepad; 
[/list]
[img]https://psv4.vk.me/c404930/u10585274/docs/f3065369b9d7/13_PrygokVKrolechyNoru_300kh300.png[/img]

